  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What this dashboard proves",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Jupiter reporting-service validation** — the record of how the `reporting-service` (jupiter-central) series were validated against the incumbent controller, keyed on `site_id`. Left = jupiter (`jupiter_savings_*` / `jupiter_reporting_*`), overlay = the retired `zeus_*` cross-check.\n\n**HISTORICAL — the zeus overlays are empty.** zeus was decommissioned 2026-07-30 (#169) and no longer emits `zeus_*`; past the 15-day Prometheus retention every zeus series on this page reads no-data. The jupiter-side panels are live and correct; the parity panels stay inert until their queries are retargeted (#165).\n\n**Independence: settled.** jupiter computes savings from its own `jupiter_state` SoC/price history (v0.8.0, 2026-07-07) and does not re-read a banked zeus value. The savings-parity soak was signed off 2026-07-20 (#164) as SAVINGS-parity, NOT logic-equivalence — the #196 inputs gate read blind throughout, so a green parity here proved the pipeline and the numbers, never the logic."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Savings parity  —  jupiter vs zeus (retired cross-check — zeus_* ended 2026-07-30)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Savings today (EUR)  —  jupiter vs zeus",
      "description": "Side-by-side. jupiter has computed savings independently since v0.8.0 (2026-07-07), so these stopped being exact-by-construction; the soak that watched the gap was signed off 2026-07-20 (#164). The zeus series ended at the 2026-07-30 decommission and now reads no-data.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyEUR",
          "decimals": 3,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "noValue": "no data"
        },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "A" }, "properties": [ { "id": "displayName", "value": "jupiter" }, { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" } } ] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "B" }, "properties": [ { "id": "displayName", "value": "zeus (live)" }, { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" } } ] }
        ]
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": [ "lastNotNull" ], "fields": "", "values": false }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "value_and_name", "orientation": "horizontal" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "max by (site_id) (jupiter_savings_today_eur{site_id=~\"$site_id\"})", "legendFormat": "jupiter", "instant": true },
        { "refId": "B", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "max by (site_id) (zeus_savings_today_eur)", "legendFormat": "zeus", "instant": true }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "|savings delta| today (EUR)  —  cutover gate",
      "description": "abs(jupiter_savings_today_eur - zeus_savings_today_eur). The ADR-0022 gate for the kiosk savings-panel migration; signed off 2026-07-20 (#164) with a worst-case gap of €0.108 across 5 clean days. Inert since the 2026-07-30 zeus decommission — with zeus_* gone the subtraction has no second term.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 5 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyEUR",
          "decimals": 4,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 0.05 }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.25 } ] },
          "noValue": "no data"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": [ "lastNotNull" ], "fields": "", "values": false }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "auto" },
      "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "jupiter_savings_parity_abs_eur{site_id=~\"$site_id\"} or abs(max by (site_id) (jupiter_savings_today_eur{site_id=~\"$site_id\"}) - max by (site_id) (zeus_savings_today_eur))", "legendFormat": "{{site_id}}", "instant": true } ]
    },
